><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.7</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>To compute <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"77\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2265\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> we will use the complement:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"78\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0p